+# 2026-10-08 Maibo customer appearance
+
+Customer-only frontend patch based on `v0.1.10` / `05a2568fee7db8be7776f5c511a19a6af2fcbf7f`.
+No upstream dependency upgrade, BFF change, data migration or IAM configuration change.
+
+- Match the PM application: Maibo logo, exact `rgb(35, 72, 111)` header, white sidebar,
+  grey workspace, teal controls, subdued borders and cards.
+- Preserve paper reading, scientific Markdown, questions, notes, theme toggle and logout.
+- Add fixed links to `https://pm.openlims.ai/dashboard` and `https://www.openlims.ai/`.
+- Keep mobile library / reader / question controls; adjust the narrow breakpoint for
+  the new sidebar. At 390×844, no horizontal page overflow was observed.
+
+Validation: lint, build, formatting, bundle budget and boundary gates passed;
+33 unit-test files / 203 tests passed. This did not run the full coverage/e2e command.
+Browser layout checks used clearly labelled synthetic local data, not customer papers.
+
+Deployed to `https://kb.openlims.ai/` as `dikw-mbweb:maibo-20261008T004840Z` by deriving
+the existing 0.1.10 image and replacing only `/app/dist`. The server bundle hash,
+runtime environment values, mounts and other ten running container IDs were unchanged.
+Production health is healthy; `/healthz` returns 200, anonymous paper API and static
+assets remain protected (401), and original OIDC client/callback/S256 remain active.
+
+Release input, hashes and deployment evidence are retained on the customer server at
+`/home/prometheus/dikw/brand-releases/maibo-20261008T004840Z/`. Protected original
+configuration is in `/home/prometheus/dikw/brand-backups/maibo-20261008T004840Z/`.
+The PM repository contains the recovery patch, publisher and detailed Chinese handover
+under `deploy/knowledge-brand/` and `deploy/parallel-test/releases/20261008-knowledge-brand.md`.
+
+The first production switch automatically rolled back because list ordering of unchanged
+Docker environment entries differed. Semantic key/value comparison was restored and a
+fresh release/backup tag passed before the final switch. Real authenticated customer UI,
+upload, Q&A and note mutation acceptance remain pending; no customer data was written.
